<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIA BEAT FRANCE 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIA BEAT FRANCE 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia defeated France 4-1 in their Davis Cup world group first round tie after the two countries shared Sunday's reverse singles. Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Cedric Pioline (France) 7-6 (7-3) 6-4 Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat Patrick Rafter (Australia) 4-6 6-4 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Australia won 4-1.</p>
</text>
